# Shelter Atoll's lagoon cave and Dr. Shogo (CIPlay shelter_atoll_cave, 11-04; in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in
# its recipe. The storeroom is barred until someone talked to Dr. Shogo; the cave's supply chest stays hidden until his
# second answer (use Dr. Shogo pick 2 - 11-05: picked in this play, so the chest is checked here; a CITalk after the play
# can't be checked, as the next play respawns the island); the den has air and a
# dry way down to the water. Pictures of Dr. Shogo, the storeroom, the dinghy by the mouth and the den.
island Shelter Atoll keep
offset 17.7389 4.5927
hour 11
weather Calm
expect hidden shelsupply

# The storeroom off the radio room: barred
at 6 0 h=1.9
use storedoor stay
expect message barred from inside
expect shown storedoor

# Dr. Shogo at the channel, sitting on his chair
snap sa_shogo shogochair 250 4 1.2
snap sa_shogo_chair shogochair 160 2.5 0.6
use Dr. Shogo
expect step 0

# His second answer (the dive): the cave's supply chest shows
use Dr. Shogo pick 2
expect shown shelsupply

# Now the bar lifts
at 6 0 h=1.9
use storedoor stay
expect message lift the bar
expect hidden storedoor
# (from beside the doorway, not on its middle line: from there the open left leaf, swung into the room on the doorway's
# middle, stood edge-on as a dark bar down the picture - RF7, 11-05)
picture sa_storeroom 4.6 3.3 0.8 6.6 2.2 8

# The dinghy by the cave's mouth on the lagoon floor, from the landing
picture sa_cave_landing 2 4 -12 -5 -3 -22
# (from beside it, looking past the wreck to the mouth: the snap's camera stood in the shore's ground - RF1)
# (under the water, from the lagoon floor: the landing's deck covers the dinghy and the mouth from above - RF1, 11-05)
picture sa_dinghy 2.5 -5.8 -14 -3 -6.8 -19.5

# Swim in: from the lagoon floor before the mouth up the flooded tunnel into the den, and breathe there (G2: no
# teleport into the pocket)
walk -2.3 -18.4 to -4 -22 to -15.5 -46.5 to -19 -54.3 to -23.6 -64 below=-3
air shelair here

# The den: dry, air, and a dry way down the tunnel to the water
walk -23.6 -64 to -19 -54.3 to -15.5 -46.5 below=7
picture sa_den_in -19 3.5 -54 -26 3 -68
picture sa_den_out -26 3.5 -68 -15 1.5 -47
air shelair
picture sa_den_outside -45 12 -45 -24 4 -64
